// # oofiles package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oofiles (layers/L4-DE).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oofiles.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oofiles.oo.
